    "host_matrix_limit": "Originalfour-cell case failed host_errors before restricted token creation, not a second independent strict-token failure.",
    "token_limit": "No token flag/SID/path-grant/ambient read/MIC/production constructor is changed. B11 remains OPEN even if this narrow repair passes."
  },
